{
  "hero_headline": "全球 AI 发展博弈：科技巨头放缓呼吁遭政治力量驳回 / AI Development Dilemma: Tech CEOs' Call for Slowdown Rejected by Politics",
  "daily_overview": "全球科技界正处于剧烈分化期，AI 巨头担忧的生存风险与政客追求的国家科技领先地位产生激烈碰撞。在科技领域，大模型推理效率与机器人具身智能持续迭代，但安全隐患引发关注。财经方面，通胀预期与地缘政治冲突（如美伊战争影响）推高了全球风险溢价，导致债券收益率攀升及企业估值震荡。时政领域，大国地缘博弈持续升级，中东冲突与欧洲选举局势为全球不确定性再添变数，迫使企业需在全球供应链与安全政策夹缝中寻求生存空间。\n\nGlobal technology is witnessing a deep divide as existential concerns from AI labs collide with the strategic pursuit of technological supremacy by national leaders. In tech, innovations in inference efficiency and embodied robotics continue, yet security failures persist. Financially, inflationary pressures and geopolitical instability, such as the conflict in Iran, are elevating risk premiums, causing turbulence in bond yields and corporate valuations. Politically, the escalation of great-power rivalries and regional instability in the Middle East and Europe add layers of uncertainty, forcing businesses to navigate complex supply chains and shifting security policies.",
